Milestone 4 native menu role parity

Reason
The rebuilt macOS menu must preserve Tauri standard Window and Help submenu identifiers; Cocoa/Tauri use those IDs to assign native menu roles. Owning Quit must not silently degrade unrelated menu behaviour.

Changes
- Construct Window and Help submenus with Tauri public WINDOW_SUBMENU_ID and HELP_SUBMENU_ID constants.
- Extend the menu contract test to preserve both roles.

